You will hear a lot of bad things about this game but trust me on this one:
THIS GAME IS AMAZING.
Top 5 reasons to buy it:
1. It will make you laugh (seriously);
2. Grind Weapons into better ones;
3. Butt slam and extra mobility;
4. Shops: Now they actually sell good guns and shields and have an improved method to sell your junk;
5. Laser guns and Torgue's hate against them.
I seriously don't understand the hate towards this game because, FOR ME, the gameplay is actually better than BL2.
I enjoyed it so much that I thought this game deserved a positive review. Additionally, I think this is the most UNDERRATED game I've ever played.

